[00:27.91] Prasanna vadanaam saubhaagyadaam bhaagyadaam
[00:37.71] Hastaabhyaam abhayapradaam maniganair-
[00:44.74] Naanaavidhair-bhuushhitaam
[00:49.26] Prasanna vadanaam saubhaagyadaam bhaagyadaam
[00:58.92] Hastaabhyaam abhayapradaam maniganair-
[01:05.82] Naanaavidhair-bhuushhitaam
[01:09.43] (Who is of smiling face, bestower of all fortunes,
[01:09.71] Whose hands are ready to rescue anyone from fear,
[01:10.37] Who is adorned by various ornaments with precious stones)
[01:11.42] Puer natus est nobis,
[01:20.73] Et filius datus est nobis:
[01:29.83] Cujus emperium super humerum...
[01:39.18] (For to us a child is born,
[01:39.35] To us a son is given:
[01:39.89] And the government will be upon his shoulder.)
[01:53.44] Prasanna vadanaam saubhaagyadaam bhaagyadaam
[02:03.19] Hastaabhyaam abhayapradaam maniganair-
[02:09.97] Naanaavidhair-bhuushhitaam
[02:56.28] Some day you came
[02:59.18] And i knew you were the one
[03:04.60] You were the rain, you were the sun
[03:09.53] But i needed both, cause i needed you
[03:17.67] You were the one
[03:20.46] I was dreaming of all my life
[03:25.66] When it is dark you are my light
[03:30.81] But don't forget
[03:32.84] Who's always our guide
[03:37.72] It is the child in us
[03:43.67] 